<!-- Email 1: the Second Chances appeal. A marketing email, so its footer
     has the unsubscribe link. -->
<mjml lang="en">
  <mj-head>
    <!-- Subject line A. Subject B is set up as an A/B test inside Engaging Networks. -->
    <mj-title>Biscuit had never stood on grass</mj-title>
    <!-- Hidden preheader: Engaging Networks fills {preview_text} from its Preview Text field -->
    <mj-preview>{preview_text}</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./layout/head.mjml" />
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#001f3d" width="600px">
    <mj-include path="./layout/header.mjml" />

    <!-- The letter. Editors can drag new blocks into this area in Engaging Networks,
         and each group inside it can be duplicated (repeatable). -->
    <mj-raw
      ><div class="en__component en__component--droppable ui-sortable"></mj-raw
    >

    <!-- Opening -->
    <mj-raw><div class="en__component en__component--repeatable"></mj-raw>
    <mj-section padding="40px 0 8px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Hi {user_data~First Name~Friend},</mj-text>
        <mj-text
          >Eight weeks ago, our team walked into a puppy mill two hours north of
          here. The first thing we noticed was the quiet. There were dozens of
          dogs in stacked wire cages, and hardly a bark between them.</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text
          >Biscuit was in a cage near the back. He was about five months old,
          underweight, and his paws were sore from standing on wire. When we
          opened the door, he didn't run to us. He pressed himself into the
          corner and watched.</mj-text
        >
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-raw></div></mj-raw>

    <!-- Biscuit's photo: shown at 520 × 260, the file is twice that size for sharp screens -->
    <mj-raw><div class="en__component en__component--repeatable"></mj-raw>
    <mj-section padding="8px 0 28px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text
          css-class="en__component en__component--imageblock"
          mj-class="image"
          padding="0 40px"
        >
          <img
            src="https://shadelourens.github.io/fernhollow-emails/assets/biscuit.jpg"
            width="520"
            height="260"
            alt="Biscuit, a small scruffy puppy, sitting on green grass."
            style="
              display: block;
              width: 100%;
              max-width: 520px;
              height: auto;
              border: 0;
              border-radius: 12px;
            "
          />
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-raw></div></mj-raw>

    <!-- What happened next -->
    <mj-raw><div class="en__component en__component--repeatable"></mj-raw>
    <mj-section padding="0 0 8px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text
          >Today, Biscuit is with a foster family. He's had his vaccinations,
          he's put on weight, and last Tuesday he stood on grass for the very
          first time. He sat down very carefully, as if he wasn't sure it was
          allowed. Then he rolled in it.</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text
          >Biscuit got his second chance because people like you gave. But there
          are still dogs waiting in places like that barn, and we can only go
          back for them if we can pay for what comes next: the vet checks, the
          vaccinations and a quiet place to recover.</mj-text
        >
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-raw></div></mj-raw>

    <!-- The ask: a cream box with an orange stripe on top, the impact line and the button -->
    <mj-raw><div class="en__component en__component--repeatable"></mj-raw>
    <mj-wrapper
      css-class="impact-wrap"
      padding="4px 40px 0"
      background-color="#ffffff"
    >
      <mj-section
        background-color="#fdf1e4"
        border-top="4px solid #e87a00"
        border-radius="0 0 12px 12px"
        padding="28px 0 30px"
      >
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text
            mj-class="heading"
            align="center"
            font-size="21px"
            line-height="29px"
            padding="0 28px 22px"
            ><h2 style="margin:0; font-family:'Nunito Sans', Arial, sans-serif; font-size:21px; line-height:29px; font-weight:700; color:#001f3d;">$50 helps give a rescued dog vaccinations and a safe place to
            recover.</h2></mj-text
          >
          <mj-button
            href="https://shadelourens.github.io/fernhollow-portfolio/?utm_source=email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=second-chances&utm_content=give-50-button"
            >Give $50 today</mj-button
          >
          <mj-text
            align="center"
            font-size="16px"
            line-height="25px"
            padding="0 28px"
            >Or
            <a
              href="https://shadelourens.github.io/fernhollow-portfolio/?utm_source=email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=second-chances&utm_content=own-amount-link"
              >choose your own amount</a
            >. Every dollar helps a dog get a second chance.</mj-text
          >
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
    </mj-wrapper>
    <mj-raw></div></mj-raw>

    <!-- Sign-off -->
    <mj-raw><div class="en__component en__component--repeatable"></mj-raw>
    <mj-section padding="36px 0 8px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Thank you for being in their corner,</mj-text>
        <mj-text line-height="24px"
          ><strong
            style="
              font-family: &quot;Nunito Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;
              font-size: 18px;
            "
            >Maya Daniels</strong
          ><br /><span style="font-size: 16px; color: #045174"
            >Rescue Coordinator, Fernhollow Animal Alliance</span
          ></mj-text
        >
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-raw></div></mj-raw>

    <!-- P.S. under a thin line -->
    <mj-raw><div class="en__component en__component--repeatable"></mj-raw>
    <mj-section padding="0 0 20px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-divider
          css-class="divider"
          border-width="1px"
          border-color="#e6eaee"
          padding="0 40px 24px"
        />
        <mj-text font-size="16px" line-height="26px"
          ><strong>P.S.</strong> Want to help all year round? A monthly gift of
          $15 helps cover regular check-ups for dogs in our care, and you can
          cancel any time. Just choose "Give monthly" when you
          <a
            href="https://shadelourens.github.io/fernhollow-portfolio/?utm_source=email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=second-chances&utm_content=ps-link"
            >get to the donation page</a
          >.</mj-text
        >
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-raw></div></mj-raw>

    <!-- End of the droppable area -->
    <mj-raw></div></mj-raw>

    <!-- Footer: teal like the header, locked in Engaging Networks so editors can't remove the
         unsubscribe link or the postal address -->
    <mj-section background-color="#045174" padding="32px 0 36px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text mj-class="footer"
          >You're receiving this because you signed up for updates from
          Fernhollow Animal Alliance.</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text mj-class="footer"
          ><a
            href="{unsubscribe_action~00000~https://act.fernhollow.example/page/00000/subscriptions/1}"
            >Manage your email preferences or unsubscribe</a
          ></mj-text
        >
        <mj-include path="./layout/footer.mjml" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
